  textComponent: {fileID: 143595766}
  lines:
  - "Kh\xE1 l\u1EAFm... Sau bao n\u0103m, cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng c\u0169ng c\xF3 k\u1EBB
    \u0111\xE1nh b\u1EA1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ta"
